config:
  sequence:
    wrap: false
    width: 190
    noteMargin: 8
title: "Code · sequence: ingest a Wijkscan folder, then build the evidence (UC1)"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Researcher
  participant UI as ui.streamlit_app<br/>(tab 1 · Data) or ingestion.cli
  participant WS as app.services<br/>Workspace
  participant WK as ingestion.wijkscan
  participant P as parsers<br/>(expert, resident, survey_tally, notes)
  participant RP as parsers.<br/>reference_parser
  participant ST as ingestion.store<br/>SourceStore
  participant EB as evidence.builder

  R->>UI: choose folder and case
  UI->>WS: ingest(folder, case_id, case_label, append=True)
  WS->>WK: is_wijkscan_folder(folder)
  WK-->>WS: true (perspective subfolders)
  WS->>WK: ingest_wijkscan_folder(root, case_id, case_label)
  loop every file, sorted (temporary ~$ and hidden files skipped)
    Note over WK: sha256_file · detect_perspective_from_path<br/>new SourceDocument
    alt same checksum seen before
      Note over WK: status = duplicate (not read twice)
    else PDF named like a report
      Note over WK: status = excluded_reference_report<br/>(evaluation only, never a drafting input)
    else PDF "vuistregels"
      Note over WK: remember its checksum (RIVM norms)
    else workbook with sheet "Notities"
      WK->>P: notes_parser.parse_notes(path, rel, case_id)
    else expert workbook (score sheets / totals)
      WK->>P: expert_parser.parse_score_sheet + parse_section_remarks<br/>or parse_totaal_scores + parse_opmerkingen
    else residents workbook
      WK->>P: resident_parser.parse_categorized_sheet<br/>survey_tally_parser.parse_file + apply_survey_mapping
    else image (png, jpg)
      Note over WK: one SourceRecord, record_kind = image<br/>(measured later by imaging, diagram 43)
    else anything else
      Note over WK: status = unparsed, with the reason
    end
    P-->>WK: SourceRecords (file, sheet, cell or row locator)
    WK->>ST: add_many(records)
  end
  WK->>RP: load_rivm_rules(pdf_checksum)
  RP-->>WK: norm records from config/reference/rivm_vuistregels.toml
  WK-->>WS: IngestionResult (store, documents, validation, cases)
  opt workspace already holds data
    Note over WS: _merge(new): keep other cases, researcher notes and<br/>image measurements whose image did not change
  end
  Note over WS: result.save(workspace/ingest)<br/>clear cached evidence
  WS-->>UI: summary (files per status, records per perspective)

  Note over R,EB: later, the first time a section is drafted or reviewed
  UI->>WS: evidence(case_id)
  alt evidence/<case>.json exists and is newer than store.json and confirmations.json
    Note over WS: EvidencePack.from_dict (cached)
  else build again
    WS->>EB: build_case_evidence(store, case_id, confirmations)
    Note over EB: expert · remark · survey · tally · coded · demografie ·<br/>image · norm · comparison · note evidence (numbers computed here)
    Note over EB: one EvidencePack per theme, Algemeen, Aanleiding,<br/>Conclusies from cross_theme_evidence
    EB-->>WS: packs, with built_with = config fingerprints
    Note over WS: write evidence/<case>.json
  end
  WS-->>UI: dict[section, EvidencePack]
